{"id":"wb-7-1317","name":"大藏寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"大藏寺","text":"大藏寺（藏语：ད་ཚང་དགོན་པ，威利转写：da tshang dgon pa，英语：Dhe-Tsang Monastery）建于1414年，是藏传佛教格鲁派在川北一带之总寺。\n大藏寺位于四川阿坝州马尔康市城正北大藏乡春口村，经大郎足沟至沙尔宗乡的林场公路54公里处以西一侧，距成都市约500公里，距马尔康县政府驻地的县城108公里。\n2007年6月1日公布为第七批四川省文物保护单位。2013年3月5日列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E8%97%8F%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":93283595,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93283595","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7f3ee8f04994869b4d0010c7.jpg","title":"Dhe-Tsang_Front_Sq_Small.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dhe-Tsang_Front_Sq_Small.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/21/Dhe-Tsang_Front_Sq_Small.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Dayten","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"Dhe-Tsang Monastery Front Square","width":320,"height":212}}